 "Exports every photo with its own film, crop and adjustments into one folder.": "把每张照片按各自的胶片、裁剪与调整导出到同一文件夹。",
 "Exports the finished image with the current crop and adjustments.": "按当前裁剪与调整导出成片。",
 "Copies the original camera RAW file. Fotufilm edits and the resolution setting are not included.": "复制原始相机 RAW 文件。不包含 Fotufilm 编辑与分辨率设置。",
 "Printing density for grading. In DaVinci Resolve, read it as Cineon Film Log.": "用于调色的印片密度。在 DaVinci Resolve 中按 Cineon Film Log 解读。",
 "Automatic lets the encoder choose. ProRes keeps its own rate.": "自动由编码器决定。ProRes 保持自身码率。",
 "Accurate uses exact film curves. Fast uses an approximation to reduce processing time.": "精确模式使用真实胶片曲线；快速模式使用近似，以减少处理时间。",
 "Standard uses fast calibrated RMS noise, and Film lays the stock’s crystals at fixed places on the emulsion.": "标准模式使用快速校准的 RMS 噪点；胶片模式把该胶片的晶体按固定位置铺在乳剂上。",
 "HDR preserves brighter highlights on compatible displays. Choose Standard for wider compatibility. It applies to HEIC exports of films that deliver HDR, without a print frame.": "HDR 可在兼容显示器上保留更亮的高光。若需更广兼容性请选择标准；它适用于会输出 HDR 的胶片的 HEIC 导出，且不带印相边框。",
 "Restores Fotufilm’s original settings. Your photographs and edits are not changed.": "恢复 Fotufilm 的初始设置。您的照片与编辑不会改变。",
 "This restores Fotufilm’s original settings. Your photos and edits will not change.": "恢复 Fotufilm 的初始设置。您的照片与编辑不会改变。",
 "Separation sets how strongly neighboring film layers affect each other during development, for both color pairs together. Red–Green and Green–Blue adjust each pair separately. Edge Contrast controls sharpening caused by development.": "分离度决定显影时相邻胶片层相互影响的强度，同时作用于两组色彩。红–绿与绿–蓝分别调整每一组。边缘反差控制显影带来的锐化。",
 "A smaller overview keeps movement smooth. Once movement settles, the visible image is developed at the display’s pixel resolution. Export develops the entire image at the selected size.": "较小的预览可让拖动更流畅。操作停下后，可见画面会按显示器像素分辨率显影；导出则按所选尺寸显影整幅图像。",
 "Individual pipeline stages are available with the film’s default film, print and filter settings.": "单独使用流水线阶段时，采用该胶片的默认胶片、印放与滤镜设置。",
 "Open a frame from a library folder of negatives: its roll is every negative in that folder.": "从负片库文件夹打开一格：整卷即该文件夹中的所有负片。",
 "Fewer than two frames of this roll show highlights to balance on. Crop away the holder, or measure a roll with more frames.": "这卷中不到两格含可用于平衡的高光。请裁掉片夹，或用画幅更多的胶卷重新测量。",
 "The installed plug-ins are from another version of Fotufilm. Updating them keeps them developing the same film this app does.": "已安装的插件来自另一个 Fotufilm 版本。更新后它们会用与本应用相同的胶片冲洗。",
 "Frames shot on one roll under one light share the colour of the roll's highlights. Each frame keeps its own exposure. Measure again after cropping or adding frames.": "同一卷、同一光源下拍摄的画面共用该卷高光的色彩。每格保持各自的曝光。裁剪或增删画幅后请重新测量。",
 "A camera or scanner channel sees a little of every dye, not just its own, which mutes the colours of a scanned negative. Raise it to separate them again. Greys stay grey: the frame's highlights read as before. Set the light the scan was made under first: separate red, green and blue LED exposures have little crosstalk to undo.": "相机或扫描仪的每个通道都会看到一点其他染料的颜色，而不只是自己那一种，这会让扫描负片的色彩变浑。调高它可重新分离它们。灰色仍为灰色：画面高光的读数保持不变。请先设定扫描时的光源：红、绿、蓝 LED 分别曝光时几乎没有串扰需要消除。",
 "This film uses a fixed profile. Reset film settings to use exposure, grading, output media and export.": "该胶片使用固定配置。重置胶片设置后才能使用曝光、调色、输出介质与导出。",
